---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Base
  room="paper"
  title="Support — Latent"
  description="Help with The Ritual, The Moment, and Latent's other apps: write to us and a person answers."
>
  <Nav />
  <main class="legal" id="main">
    <div class="legal-label">Support</div>
    <h1>Support</h1>
    <p class="legal-lead">Write to us and a person answers, usually within a day.</p>

    <h2>The Ritual</h2>
    <p><a href="mailto:ritual@latentstudios.art">ritual@latentstudios.art</a> &mdash; questions, a photograph that doesn&rsquo;t develop as it should (tell us which camera), or anything about your plan.</p>

    <h2>Plans and purchases</h2>
    <p>Bought in the Mac App Store: Apple manages the payment. To cancel or change a monthly or yearly plan, open the App Store, click your name, then Account Settings &rarr; Subscriptions. To restore a plan on another Mac, open The Ritual, choose <em>Choose a plan</em>, then <em>Restore Purchases</em>. Refunds are requested from Apple at <a href="https://reportaproblem.apple.com">reportaproblem.apple.com</a>.</p>
    <p>Bought through Latent Manager: write to <a href="mailto:ritual@latentstudios.art">ritual@latentstudios.art</a>.</p>

    <h2>The Moment</h2>
    <p><a href="mailto:moment@latentstudios.art">moment@latentstudios.art</a></p>

    <h2>Privacy</h2>
    <p>See our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>, or write to <a href="mailto:privacy@latentstudios.art">privacy@latentstudios.art</a>.</p>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Base>
